# cross-lib-activity-collision — Lib B2 (second shared disposition library).
library "SharedB".

// Defines an activity named `Deny` — SAME name as SharedA's. Because
// `recommendationIdForLib` is policy-id-scoped, both collapse onto one id/url.
activity "Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Denied by B.`.
